config APP_VKMARK
	bool "vkmark Vulkan benchmark substrate port"
	default n
	select LIBUKVIRTIO_GPU
	select LIBUKDMA
	select LIBUKVIRTGPU_DRM
	select LIBUKVK_ICD
	help
	  vkmark Vulkan benchmark ported to Unikraft as a vk.drm-shim+vk.icd substrate proof.
	  vkmark is an open-source Vulkan benchmarking tool that exercises scenes
	  similar to glmark2 but using the Vulkan API instead of OpenGL ES.
	  Upstream: https://github.com/vkmark/vkmark
	  Uses libukvk_icd (vk.icd) over libukvirtgpu_drm (vk.drm-shim) to initialize a
	  Venus/Vulkan context, enumerate 10 scenes, and document the blocked
	  rendering path (requires Venus command encoder for fps evidence).
	  Evidence row: gfx.vkmark (pass-substrate: vk.drm-shim+vk.icd init + scene enumeration).
